01:04:49.218 --> 01:04:50.386
Give

816
01:04:53.097 --> 01:04:54.140
Thank you.

817
01:05:25.087 --> 01:05:28.633
And this is really the right place
discuss such things?

818
01:05:29.383 --> 01:05:30.343
Really?

819
01:05:41.687 --> 01:05:42.813
What?

820
01:05:43.397 --> 01:05:44.315
You don't like it?

821
01:05:47.068 --> 01:05:49.987
Nothing. It's not your style.

822
01:06:15.554 --> 01:06:16.389
Who…

823
01:06:17.890 --> 01:06:19.016
are you like that

824
01:06:19.976 --> 01:06:21.435
Why are you so surprised?

825
01:06:22.436 --> 01:06:25.064
I can do all the same things as you.

826
01:06:25.648 --> 01:06:27.400
Because I gave you those powers.

827
01:06:55.803 --> 01:06:58.723
"SUNVOL FOUNDATION"

828
01:07:11.485 --> 01:07:12.528
You…

829
01:07:14.530 --> 01:07:15.948
God?

830
01:07:18.409 --> 01:07:20.411
This is one of my names.

831
01:07:20.494 --> 01:07:23.205
Some call me the universe.

832
01:07:23.289 --> 01:07:25.583
Others call me time.

833
01:07:26.167 --> 01:07:27.835
You know, as they say.

834
01:07:27.918 --> 01:07:31.630
"God is everywhere and in everything."

835
01:07:32.923 --> 01:07:33.758
as for me

836
01:07:34.884 --> 01:07:37.094
then it seems that God is nowhere.

837
01:07:37.887 --> 01:07:40.014
Unruly, that's how a demon should be.

838
01:07:40.973 --> 01:07:43.851
Just to think that we flew halfway around the world

839
01:07:44.477 --> 01:07:46.145
for blasphemy.

840
01:07:46.771 --> 01:07:48.064
i believe you

841
01:07:49.148 --> 01:07:50.274
so give me back

842
01:07:51.400 --> 01:07:52.276
my strength

843
01:07:53.235 --> 01:07:54.403
I can't do it.

844
01:07:55.654 --> 01:07:58.032
- What?
- Although I gave you strength,

845
01:07:58.115 --> 01:07:59.825
I did not take them from you.

846
01:08:04.705 --> 01:08:07.208
Did this happen because I didn't sign a new agreement?

847
01:08:07.291 --> 01:08:10.836
Will I get my powers back if I make a deal right away?

848
01:08:11.420 --> 01:08:13.339
Agreements will not change anything.

849
01:08:13.422 --> 01:08:15.299
Since the powers are in the wrong body,

850
01:08:15.382 --> 01:08:18.803
it's only natural that they melt
until they disappear.

851
01:08:21.180 --> 01:08:23.140
Then I…

852
01:08:24.934 --> 01:08:26.018
That's right.

853
01:08:27.311 --> 01:08:29.522
You are dying as we speak.

854
01:08:38.864 --> 01:08:40.366
CHOO SOK HOON
GENERAL DIRECTOR

855
01:08:40.449 --> 01:08:42.576
It seems that To To Hee is very dear to you.

856
01:08:44.411 --> 01:08:47.706
Few people will do so much
even for the closest relatives,

857
01:08:48.290 --> 01:08:50.292
not that cousin.

858
01:08:50.376 --> 01:08:52.294
To Hee is more than family to me.

859
01:08:57.550 --> 01:08:58.926
We have something in common.

860
01:09:02.304 --> 01:09:03.305
So tell me.

861
01:09:04.140 --> 01:09:05.724
Why did you want to see me?

862
01:09:06.308 --> 01:09:08.018
i think you know

863
01:09:09.353 --> 01:09:11.021
who really is Mr. Jeon.

864
01:09:14.066 --> 01:09:15.985
Then how do I get my strength back?

865
01:09:16.068 --> 01:09:17.653
There must be a way.

866
01:09:21.866 --> 01:09:22.825
It's simple.

867
01:09:25.244 --> 01:09:26.745
<i>He is a demon.</i>

868
01:09:27.538 --> 01:09:30.124
Also known as the devil.

869
01:09:36.547 --> 01:09:38.215
You can get your strength back

870
01:09:39.258 --> 01:09:40.301
as soon as that woman dies.

871
01:10:07.661 --> 01:10:09.788
<i>He brings misfortune to people</i>

872
01:10:09.872 --> 01:10:11.999
and leads them to hell.

873
01:10:27.264 --> 01:10:29.892
MY BELOVED DEMON

874
01:11:05.344 --> 01:11:07.680
{\an8}<i>When the moon is full,
the roulette wheel will</i>stop

875
01:11:07.763 --> 01:11:09.265
{\an8}<i>and the game ends,
no matter what the result will be.</i>

876
01:11:09.348 --> 01:11:10.724
{\an8}Let's not stay up all night tonight.

877
01:11:10.808 --> 01:11:13.811
{\an8}<i>It just seems
it's so wasteful to sleep through the night.</i>

878
01:11:13.894 --> 01:11:16.021
{\an8}We never went on a honeymoon.
Here we go.

879
01:11:16.105 --> 01:11:17.731
{\an8}<i>The world without you scares me.</i>

880
01:11:17.815 --> 01:11:20.943
{\an8}As I said, I will correct you.

881
01:11:22.361 --> 01:11:25.197
{\an8}The only thing you can do
for him to do is to die.

882
01:11:25.281 --> 01:11:26.949
{\an8}You mean nothing to me.

883
01:11:27.032 --> 01:11:28.033
{\an8}<i>I will not back down from any of us.</i>

884
01:11:28.117 --> 01:11:30.035
{\an8}I choose both myself and To To Hee.

885
01:11:31.620 --> 01:11:32.579
{\an8}<i>Let's make bets.</i>

886
01:11:34.581 --> 01:11:39.586
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

